Adaptations: JCS object signing helpers; monotonic DCT creation, attenuation and
chain verification; TaskContract signing and verification dispatcher; MCP tool
interception. ACP replaces DelegateOS BLAKE2b/SJT identity and wire format with
SHA-256, Ed25519 did:key and ACP schemas, and adds fail-closed argument-schema
inheritance, bilateral acknowledgements, quota enforcement and approval gates.
